                        "word": "radiograph"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "19b8b05f-77e2-39e4-9c0d-e4b7dccb0967",
                "word": "radiogram",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8a0c8dc8-1dad-4ffe-bf40-9d9654766a80",
                        "entry_id": "19b8b05f-77e2-39e4-9c0d-e4b7dccb0967",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "radiograms"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ebf09005-82a9-3d40-b6fb-3ab483978dc6",
                        "entry_id": "19b8b05f-77e2-39e4-9c0d-e4b7dccb0967",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of radiotelegram (“a message, like a telegram, transmitted by wireless telegraphy (“telegraphy by radio rather than by transmission cables”)”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5adc59bb-c38b-4aef-a416-0adb7ac21e21",
                                "sense_id": "ebf09005-82a9-3d40-b6fb-3ab483978dc6",
                                "text": "Sec. 7. That a person, company, or corporation within the jurisdiction of the United States shall not knowingly utter or transmit, or cause to be uttered or transmitted, any false or fraudulent distress signal or call or false or fraudulent signal, call, or other radiogram of any kind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a21fbaa-1a94-4344-a8b2-a864a8f27c73",
                                "sense_id": "ebf09005-82a9-3d40-b6fb-3ab483978dc6",
                                "text": "If the War Department at that time had considered it necessary to alert the Hawaiian Department against air and ground attack, it undoubtedly would have so directed instead of sending a long radiogram outlining the various steps that should be taken in connection with sabotage and subversive activities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6430f5c8-80cd-4256-8898-e719d11c3b64",
                                "sense_id": "ebf09005-82a9-3d40-b6fb-3ab483978dc6",
                                "text": "On 3 June, 1898, Lord Kelvin visited [Guglielmo] Marconi's Alum Bay station, on the Isle of Wight, and sent from there the first paid radiograms."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74568ad2-1979-4837-b77f-339361a6e208",
                                "sense_id": "ebf09005-82a9-3d40-b6fb-3ab483978dc6",
                                "text": "But in his February 12 radiogram Brett had also ordered Barnes to send two pursuit squadrons to Darwin, one for local protection and the other to provide escort for a convoy to Koepang and to provide cover for its unloading, then to remain at Koepang."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a312904b-1723-48cc-8a96-17ca28314969",
                        "source_entry_id": "19b8b05f-77e2-39e4-9c0d-e4b7dccb0967",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebf09005-82a9-3d40-b6fb-3ab483978dc6",
                        "source_sense_description": "message, like a telegram, transmitted by wireless telegraphy — see also radiotelegram",
                        "target_lang_word": "radiogramme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "radiogramme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45e6fa1a-526f-34fa-9522-978918071bb9",
                                        "entry_id": "0838ef1b-18ef-38b6-99bf-6eae61cc87b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dépêche par télégraphie sans fil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Histoire des télécommunications"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e64e3355-d52f-47e0-9f91-698cf1b03238",
                                                "sense_id": "45e6fa1a-526f-34fa-9522-978918071bb9",
                                                "text": "« Élaborons donc notre plan d’action : dès ma libération, je m’abouche avec le gardien-chef du sémaphore. Je suppose que vos dollars le convainquent. Il consent à envoyer le radiogramme. Je suppose encore que la princesse se rende à votre appel. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b135e3ec-d4a5-48c9-9180-5836bd4eaaa2",
                                                "sense_id": "45e6fa1a-526f-34fa-9522-978918071bb9",
                                                "text": "Un radiogramme du « Gustav Holm » confirmait leurs dires en félicitant notre compagnon, fou de joie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b67e9a69-fcc2-4de3-b368-61f56aa8ad3c",
                                                "sense_id": "45e6fa1a-526f-34fa-9522-978918071bb9",
                                                "text": "- Rose, Rose, ici Tempête, j'attends la réponse à mon radiogramme … attends réponse … Passe à l'écoute, je passe à l'écoute."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97bb6864-ac38-4753-8b5a-e8fac8b0c745",
                                                "sense_id": "45e6fa1a-526f-34fa-9522-978918071bb9",
                                                "text": "Peu de temps avant l’heure H, on diffusa le radiogramme suivant : « S. M. l’empereur et Hindenburg se sont rendus sur le théâtre des opérations »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aae682ca-d3ce-3985-8656-a824eee85593",
                                        "entry_id": "0838ef1b-18ef-38b6-99bf-6eae61cc87b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom peu utilisé pour désigner l'image obtenue par la technique de radiographie aux rayons X. On dit généralement une radio ou une radiographie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
